# Paths where the marker text (REPLAY and PROTOLOG lines) is legitimate in this repo:
# the kit documents, tests and cleans those markers. One glob per line; the squash gate
# (lib/helpers/git-checks.sh squash-gate) reads this file from the BASE branch, so a
# branch cannot exempt its own marker. Keep every entry bound to a file or an extension,
# never to a whole directory.
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
hooks/protolog-restore.py
hooks/replay-restore.py
lib/helpers/git-checks.sh
docs/**/*.md
lib/**/*.md
skills/**/*.md
tests/**/*.sh
